{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05370","headline":"奉和御制旋师喜捷 · 裴漼","name":"奉和御制旋师喜捷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殊类骄无长，王师示有征。\n中军才受律，妖寇已亡精。\n斩虏还遮塞，绥降更筑城。\n从来攻必克，天策振奇兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴漼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}